State 0

    0 $accept: • program $end

    error    shift, and go to state 1
    INT      shift, and go to state 2
    CHAR     shift, and go to state 3
    STRUCT   shift, and go to state 4
    TYPEDEF  shift, and go to state 5
    TYPEID   shift, and go to state 6

    program                    go to state 7
    function_declaration_list  go to state 8
    function_declaration       go to state 9
    type_spec                  go to state 10
    declaration                go to state 11
    function                   go to state 12


